A learner uses 5 equal paper strips to measure. How many paper strips were used? Let

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:33.684
us think carefully. Count one unit each time: 5 paper strips. The answer is 5. Great

00:00:33.684 --> 00:00:34.030
work!

